<!--Post: 3091--><!--Time: 1104446549-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3091"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:dammitslicky@cox.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 2:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Good idea, Skov! Where were you yesterday when I needed you? It might be worth a trip back over there just to see if the employees remember him. If he is a regular I bet they do. How many old farts do you see sporting sneakers and a golfball cap? With a houndstooth coat no less........<!--/Text--></td></tr>
