<!--Post: 3093--><!--Time: 1104447152-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3093"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 30, 2004 - 2:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Wish I was there Cougar, I sure would have taken a little chat with the guy, BUT I´m in Denmark, Europe you know! SO I guess I have to assist you by  spirt and on this board <IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
