<!--/Post: 3193-->
<!--Post: 3207--><!--Time: 1104617884-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3207"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 01, 2005 - 2:18 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->And here I&#39;ve been thinking how it is to be a white female in her 40&#39;s right now, with three kids to worry about, hoping the serial killer loose in our city doesn&#39;t kill anyone else. How utterly selfish of me. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
