<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3228"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 01, 2005 - 9:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Okay, Wade, we&#39;ll station you at the counter and I&#39;ll work the drive-in window.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3228-->
<!--Post: 3233--><!--Time: 1104645501-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3233"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 01, 2005 - 9:58 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Me Too! <BR>Me Too! <BR>I want to be the employee who is supposed to cleans the toilets.  That way when I spend &#42;all&#42; my time in the restaurant, &#40;drinking coffee and watching for BTK&#41;, no one will think anything is out of place.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3233-->
<!--Post: 3236--><!--Time: 1104648424-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3236"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 01, 2005 - 10:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I believe it would be more productive to search for BLT at a veggie place such as the Moosewood Cafe.  I was in there once, and this guy, who would now be in his early 60&#39;s, called me &#34;dude&#34;. <BR> <BR>Nevertheless, I would prefer to stake out BK.  To address any connection between myself and Spongebob merchandise, I would say that this is false. <BR> <BR>Tom - you are free to stop us at any time if we are becoming too rowdy.  &#40;Please don&#39;t!&#41;  -pax56<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3236-->
<!--Post: 3237--><!--Time: 1104649089-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3237"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 01, 2005 - 10:58 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->We get BM to make sandwich of Bacon,Tomato and Kale and tied with string.   <BR> <BR> <BR>I can see the Ad: <BR>            Order a  BTK. They&#39;re so slippery that even with our best knots they try to escape. Only $1.00 each.  Take two home eat them slowly and privately.  <BR>                <BR> <BR>                                                                                    I figure if anyone buys two as a takeout, we have enough PC for a citizens arrest; we leap from concealment and put the collective nab on him.  Cougar can blind him with her cell phone flashes. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR>Count me in!! <BR> <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:whoisbtk@yahoo.com">whoisbtk@yahoo.com</a> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3237-->
<!--Post: 3241--><!--Time: 1104657583-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3241"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 1:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->URGENT UPDATE TO ALL POSTERS IN THIS THREAD <BR> <BR>The letters in the words: <BR> <BR>“bind lettuce torture dude moosewood café” <BR> <BR>if rearranged, &#40;through the use of Writing Style Analysis,to reveal their true meaning&#41;are: <BR> <BR>&#34;A bound cruet cowed foes, eluded our titter-comet!&#34;  <BR> <BR>The significance of this to our undercover operations at BM, cannot be taken too lightly. <BR> <BR>Perhaps Tom could ask the Catch BTK bus group to pose as a Grey Line Tour in case we need backup... <BR> <BR> <BR>&#40;happy new year everyone&#41; <BR> <BR><a href="mailto:whoisbtk@yahoo.com">whoisbtk@yahoo.com</a> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3241-->
<!--Post: 3242--><!--Time: 1104657836-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3242"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Whoisbtk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Whoisbtk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 1:23 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Oops! <BR> <BR>For BM in the two previous posts, read BK <BR> <BR>&#34;there goes a man in a freudian slip&#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3242-->
<!--Post: 3251--><!--Time: 1104681504-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3251"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 7:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Alright, alright. You&#39;ve succeeded in making me feel absolutely silly now. Happy?  <BR> <BR>Sheesh.......<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3251-->
<!--Post: 3252--><!--Time: 1104683695-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3252"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 8:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->It`s NOT you who is the silly one Cougar! it is the posters posting silly posts who are silly... <BR> <BR>hugs...skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3252-->
<!--Post: 3253--><!--Time: 1104686971-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3253"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 9:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No, Skov, I am absolutely silly. But thanks for the support, lol.  <BR> <BR>Hugs, <BR> <BR>Cougar<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3253-->
<!--Post: 3260--><!--Time: 1104703265-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3260"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wade<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wade<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 2:01 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Geeshhhh....Skov..you really think the BK lead is something that needs checked out? lol...I was just at mcdonalds and there were 5 old white guys that &#34;resemble&#34; the sketch.  Should we but them all?  Put out an APB for old guys in all fast food restraunts ?? <BR>There was also an old guy by himself at church.  Maybe we can do some undercover op&#39;s there too.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3260-->
<!--Post: 3266--><!--Time: 1104705478-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3266"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 2:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Wade <BR> <BR>If you read my respons to post # 1 in this thred,  I wrote that did not think that the old man was BTK, but I still think that one should respect when a person has a strong intuitive feeling. But you are right the situation is a long shot, but then again who knows if a long shot is the right shot.  <BR>I´m sure a LOT of the leeds that WPD has recived also is based on intuitive feelings and one of those persons might be the once who are right. <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3266-->
<!--Post: 3275--><!--Time: 1104721683-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3275"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 02, 2005 - 7:08 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Well my theory is that BTK is dead. Eating too much fast food may or may not have been a contributing factor. But I give Cougar credit. After getting a wee bit defensive she loosened up and let us have some fun. Keep your eyes open, Coug.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3275-->
<!--Post: 3297--><!--Time: 1104757289-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3297"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 03, 2005 - 5:01 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m usually a good sport, Sherlock. God knows that if others can laugh at me I might as well have a good time laughing at myself too. Life&#39;s too short.......<IMG SRC="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/clipart/happy.gif" ALT=":-&#41;" BORDER=0> <BR> <BR>Skov - it&#39;s all good. You just wait till LE nabs the old buzzard, waiting in line for a Whopper. We&#39;ll see who laughs last. &#42;wink&#42; <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3297-->
<!--Post: 3370--><!--Time: 1104838552-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3370"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nugzter<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nugzter<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 3:35 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Ok if BTK doesn&#39;t eat BLT&#39;s at BK, what does he eat? Is there something that the profiler missed? Just kidding.. But the golf link seems to be something to look into. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3370-->
<!--Post: 3380--><!--Time: 1104849920-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3380"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sherlock<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sherlock<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 6:45 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->PBJ at home. Beef jerky. McRib. <BR> <BR>Interesting question, Nugzter. What do you think he eats. I bet he has a crappy diet. He probably does go to the Burger King and Dairy Queen. TV dinners are a staple. Could you really imagine this guy being all that health conscious. <BR> <BR>And not a lot on this site about BTK&#39;s marital status. Or I&#39;m missing it &#40;very possible&#41;. Here&#39;s a new theory: He&#39;s lived with his mother all this time! She was cooking for him until she died about a year ago. Now he&#39;s got to fend for himself.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3380-->
<!--Post: 3381--><!--Time: 1104852656-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3381"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 04, 2005 - 7:30 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think this warrants a check into the menu at the LW Clapp golf course. What do you think? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 3381-->
